Dataset
The project uses the xAPI-Edu-Data dataset, which contains information about students, their participation, resource usage, attendance, and academic performance.

Libraries Used
Pandas – Used for loading, cleaning, and analyzing the dataset.

Matplotlib – Used for creating different charts and graphs.

Seaborn – Used for creating statistical visualizations and improving the presentation of charts.

Task Work
In this task, I:

Loaded and explored the dataset.

Checked the data structure and missing values.

Removed duplicate records.

Analyzed different student-related factors.

Created bar charts and histograms.

Created box plots and scatter plots.

Created a correlation heatmap.

Compared student participation and resource usage with performance.

Identified useful patterns and insights from the visualizations.

Visualizations
